    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nAdverse Effects (5) : Topiramate\n\n(1) Somnolence\n(2) Stupidification\n\n(3) Weight loss\n\n(4) Urolithiasis\n\n(5) Acute angle-closure glaucoma\n\n(Treatment must be stopped if acute angle-closure glaucoma presents)\n\n[Image: 68e85ac7e048e07c6518f2013595889c3aa004f3d3efff8ca02bdcd6a1b120e6]\n\n[Image: 4cc5b0a7011f60de0a726733839cd9bab6c8cac3ba9bc22210cf7c393c510cda]\n\n[Image: 7192102d29e4c07297d06ca50c63d4e0305bb369a7ef5d3cd7a083cb76a55a2c]\n\n[Image: 477935c2f740b66947b479658e714d4268f50c3f0e224ca4e2592485556fac3b]\n\n[Image: 982588f7f0063b08604134a17f46dabda9c662f07bba9854bceb289b85c451dd]\n\n4.2 - Valproate, topiramate, lamotrigine, levetiracetam\n[Image: b6de6841506ab44b40652032e6f4399bd43ac8406f2030d1079500c79bf295cc]\n\n[Image: b8b1970180a64ab677591daccf17df025d56a38b8299d8e02740e57c40193d7c]\n\n[Image: c3043f3c2f396c1132e341dc2c19a439589ba89eef0f5980c4f478d378b35668]\n\n[Image: 2bab7a24324cb36e7d3115a5c4ada1905c53d6eb86e4080b17774ff251e1158a]\n\n[Image: fb3ad4700cf08245689b08fc53ae5cccaa6480e193f08f2f661cc14acd0021f5]",
